  {
    "sheet": "xl/worksheets/sheet1.xml",
    "cell": "E8",
    "value": "Every company registered in Gibraltar, or having assessable income in Gibraltar, is required to make a full and complete return of its income by the filing date, in accordance with section 29 of the Income Tax Act 2010 (\"ITA 2010\").  A return must be submitted even if there is no tax liability in the period covered by the return.  "
